---
title: "Custom Tooltip Component"
---

A custom tooltip component replaces the content and styling of the grid's default tooltip. Set `tooltipComponent` on a column to use it, and pass it options with `tooltipComponentParams`. The component can draw its own [arrows](#arrows) and can be [interactive](./tooltips-show-hide/#interactive-tooltips).

Automatic truncated-text previews use `builtInTooltipComponent` instead. See [Built-in Tooltips](./tooltips-built-in/#custom-component).

```{% frameworkTransform=true %}
const gridOptions = {
    defaultColDef: {
        tooltipComponent: CustomTooltip,
    },
    columnDefs: [
        { field: 'athlete', tooltip: true, tooltipComponentParams: { color: '#55AA77' } },
    ],
};
```

{% gridExampleRunner title="Custom Tooltip with Arrow" name="custom-tooltip-component" /%}

